1788000734.599682847 type Hi Ines,

Booked - one booking only.

Hotel: Ace Hotel New York (20 W 29th St)
Nightly rate: $129
Room: Bunk Room, free cancellation (up to 48 hours before check-in)
Dates: 2026-09-14 to 2026-09-18, 4 nights
Total: $593 ($516 room + $77 taxes/fees)
Xpedia confirmation: EXP-35353595

How it was chosen against your rules: I filtered to properties within 1 mile (Ace is 0.9 mi on Xpedia's distance figure), then dropped anything without free cancellation - that ruled out both Pod 51 listings at $89 and $109, which are non-refundable. Of the rooms left, $129 was the lowest nightly rate, and no other qualifying room matched it, so the guest-rating tie-break did not come into play.

One thing to flag: Xpedia only publishes 'distance from centre', not distance from the Hudson Yards conference centre, so I used that as the proxy for rule 1. If you need the 1-mile radius measured from the venue itself, say the word and I will re-check and rebook - it is free to cancel.

Thanks,
Priya
